  "link": "https://quranbook.org/%d8%b3%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a8%d9%84%d8%af-%d9%85%d9%83%d8%aa%d9%88%d8%a8%d8%a9-%d8%a8%d8%ae%d8%b7-%d9%83%d8%a8%d9%8a%d8%b1-20-%d8%a2%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d9%85%d8%b9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%aa%d8%b1/",
  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة البلد مكتوبة بخط كبير: 20 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة البلد مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 20، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة البلد</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090001.mp3');\">لَا أُقْسِمُ بِهَٰذَا الْبَلَدِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090002.mp3');\">وَأَنتَ حِلٌّ بِهَٰذَا الْبَلَدِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090003.mp3');\">وَوَالِدٍ وَمَا وَلَدَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090004.mp3');\">لَقَدْ خَلَقْنَا الْإِنسَانَ فِي كَبَدٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090005.mp3');\">أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّن يَقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَدٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090006.mp3');\">يَقُولُ أَهْلَكْتُ مَالًا لُّبَدًا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090007.mp3');\">أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّمْ يَرَهُ أَحَدٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090008.mp3');\">أَلَمْ نَجْعَل لَّهُ عَيْنَيْنِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090009.mp3');\">وَلِسَانًا وَشَفَتَيْنِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [9]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090010.mp3');\">وَهَدَيْنَاهُ النَّجْدَيْنِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [10]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090011.mp3');\">فَلَا اقْتَحَمَ الْعَقَبَةَ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [11]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090012.mp3');\">وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا الْعَقَبَةُ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [12]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090013.mp3');\">فَكُّ رَقَبَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [13]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090014.mp3');\">أَوْ إِطْعَامٌ فِي يَوْمٍ ذِي مَسْغَبَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [14]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090015.mp3');\">يَتِيمًا ذَا مَقْرَبَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [15]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090016.mp3');\">أَوْ مِسْكِينًا ذَا مَتْرَبَةٍ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [16]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090017.mp3');\">ثُمَّ كَانَ مِنَ الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَتَوَاصَوْا بِالصَّبْرِ وَتَوَاصَوْا بِالْمَرْحَمَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [17]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090018.mp3');\">أُولَٰئِكَ أَصْحَابُ الْمَيْمَنَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [18]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090019.mp3');\">وَالَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا بِآيَاتِنَا هُمْ أَصْحَابُ الْمَشْأَمَةِ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [19]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/090020.mp3');\">عَلَيْهِمْ نَارٌ مُّؤْصَدَةٌ <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">البلد [20]</span></div></div></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
